sequenceDiagram
    participant C as client.py
    participant M as multiplexer
    participant O as worker alpha, leaving
    participant N as worker alpha-v2
    N->>M: connects, a second INFERENCE peer
    Note over O: its drain file appears
    O->>M: PEER_CONTROL, route me nothing new
    M->>O: PEER_STATUS, in effect
    C->>M: INFER_REQUEST
    M->>N: INFER_REQUEST, to alpha-v2 only now
    N->>M: INFER_RESPONSE
    M->>C: INFER_RESPONSE
    Note over O: answers what it already had, then leaves
